// Out of scope of the ir pipeline: a task that runs a callback more than once
// (a fallback of stage R0j). A `multi` operation of a handler of a caller in a
// clause is in scope from stage R0k-c2. From plan stage R0z Z9a a spawn has a
// second node of the run, so the task is a branch of a `fork`, which has none.
fn twice(f: fn()) { f(); f() }
fn main() / par {
    let c = 1
    let f = || print(c)
    let _ = fork(|| twice(f), || print(2))
}
